28. Conclusion

The Hospital Management System will provide a centralized platform for managing patients, appointments, medical records and hospital users.

This SRS provides a common understanding of what the project should achieve and what each team is responsible for. Any major changes or additional features should be discussed by the team before implementation so that the frontend, backend, database, security, QA and DevOps teams remain aligned.
